Name: plasma-wayland-protocols
URL: https://github.com/KDE/plasma-wayland-protocols
Version: 1.3.0
Revision: 0b07950714b3a36c9b9f71fc025fc7783e82926e
Date: 2021-04-30
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: LGPL-2.1
License File: src/COPYING.LIB
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Wayland protocol extensions exposed by the KWin Wayland compositor, which is
used by the KDE Plasma desktop environment. //third_party/wayland-protocols
builds org_kde_kwin_appmenu and org_kde_kwin_idle from src/src/protocols/.

src/ is a Git submodule of the upstream repository, mirrored at
https://chromium.googlesource.com/external/github.com/KDE/plasma-wayland-protocols
